{"ID":178220,"post_author":"2711","post_date":"2025-08-04 14:59:14","post_date_gmt":"2025-08-04 13:59:14","post_content":"","post_title":"6- Tantra","post_excerpt":"","post_status":"publish","comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","post_password":"","post_name":"5-tantra","to_ping":"","pinged":"","post_modified":"2025-08-04 16:16:25","post_modified_gmt":"2025-08-04 15:16:25","post_content_filtered":"","post_parent":0,"guid":"https:\/\/www.erescambio.com\/bloque_texto\/5-tantra\/","menu_order":0,"post_type":"bloque_texto","post_mime_type":"","comment_count":"0","filter":"raw","author":"2711","id":178220,"individual":false,"acf":{"texto_a_mostrar":"libre","texto":"<h3 data-start=\"159\" data-end=\"193\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">Sexualidad consciente y tantra<\/span><\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"195\" data-end=\"580\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">El tantra es un camino de reconexi\u00f3n contigo mismo, una pr\u00e1ctica ancestral que honra el cuerpo, la energ\u00eda sexual y la espiritualidad como v\u00edas de transformaci\u00f3n y autoconocimiento. A trav\u00e9s de la respiraci\u00f3n, el movimiento, la presencia y el placer consciente, el tantra invita a liberar bloqueos, sanar la relaci\u00f3n con el cuerpo y vivir la sexualidad desde el amor y la autenticidad.<\/span><\/p>\n<p data-start=\"582\" data-end=\"912\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Entre otras modalidades, ofrezco un <strong>enfoque espec\u00edfico para mujeres<\/strong>, enfocado en despertar la energ\u00eda femenina (Shakti) y recuperar el placer de habitar el cuerpo con libertad, sin miedo ni verg\u00fcenza. En este espacio se trabaja el equilibrio entre lo femenino y lo masculino interior, se aprenden l\u00edmites sanos y se cultivan v\u00ednculos m\u00e1s conscientes.<\/span><\/p>\n<p data-start=\"914\" data-end=\"1038\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong data-start=\"914\" data-end=\"942\">Modalidades disponibles:<\/strong><\/span><br data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"945\" \/><br \/>\n<span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Sesiones individuales y en pareja \u00b7 Clases \u00b7 Talleres presenciales \u00b7 Retiros en la naturaleza<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Si quieres recibir el calendario de los pr\u00f3ximos talleres, clases y retiros de tantra, escr\u00edbeme y te enviar\u00e9 el calendario de los pr\u00f3ximos meses.<\/span><\/p>\n","boton":"QUIERO RECIBIR EL CALENDARIO","url_boton":"https:\/\/api.whatsapp.com\/send?phone=34630127319&text=Hola%20Gemma%2C%20estoy%20en%20tu%20p%C3%A1gina%20web%20y%20me%20gustar%C3%ADa%20recibir%20m%C3%A1s%20informaci%C3%B3n%20sobre%20las%20pr\u00f3ximas%20actividades%20de%20tantra.","abrir_en_nueva_ventana":false,"imagen_a_mostrar":"libre","estilos":{"imagen_completa_desktop":false,"imagen_completa_movil":false,"alineacion_titulo":"left","alineacion":"left","eliminar_margenes":false,"mostrar_colores":false,"color_de_fondo":"","color_de_titulo":"","color_de_texto":"","color_de_enlace":""},"imagenes_laterales":{"imagen_izquierda":false,"imagen_central":false,"imagen_derecha":{"ID":178229,"id":178229,"title":"TANTRA","filename":"TANTRA.png","filesize":2521713,"url":"https:\/\/cdn.erescambio.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/TANTRA.png","link":"https:\/\/www.erescambio.com\/bloque_texto\/5-tantra\/tantra-4\/","alt":"","author":"2711","description":"","caption":"","name":"tantra-4","status":"inherit","uploaded_to":178220,"date":"2025-08-04 14:45:02","modified":"2025-08-04 14:45:02","menu_order":0,"mime_type":"image\/png","type":"image","subtype":"png","icon":"https:\/\/www.erescambio.com\/wp-includes\/images\/media\/default.png","width":1024,"height":1536,"sizes":{"thumbnail":"https:\/\/cdn.erescambio.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/TANTRA-150x150.png","thumbnail-width":150,"thumbnail-height":150,"medium":"https:\/\/cdn.erescambio.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/TANTRA-200x300.png","medium-width":200,"medium-height":300,"medium_large":"https:\/\/cdn.erescambio.com\/wp-content\/upload